WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.596
How does a rep track their van stock from their phone and accept a new load in Field Sales?

2
00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:11.104
In the bottom bar, tap My stock. The My van stock screen opens with all the items currently in your van.

3
00:00:12.033 --> 00:00:19.872
Next to each item you see the quantity remaining in the van, and under its name what you loaded and what you sold, so you know what you have before every visit.

4
00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:28.223
If you need goods, tap the button at the top of the screen. The load form or the goods request form opens, where you pick items and quantities.
